                              "cleanSource":  "LayoutMainTable.Class = ThemeClass:MainContainerNoBackground\n\t\u0026User = GAMRepository.GetUserToOTPAuthentication(\u0026AuthenticationTypeName, \u0026UseTwoFactorAuthentication, \u0026Errors)\n\tIf \u0026Errors.Count \u003e 0\n\t\t\u0026UserPassword.Visible\t= False\n\t\tBtnEnter.Visible\t\t\t= False\n\t\tDo \u0027DisplayMessages\u0027\n\tElse\n\t\t//Gets last error in the GAM \n\t\t\u0026Errors = GAMRepository.GetLastErrors()\n\t\tFor \u0026Error in \u0026Errors\n\t\t\tMsg(\u0026Error.Message)\n\t\tEndFor\n\t\t\u0026UserName \t\t= \u0026User.Name\n\tEndif\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\t\u0026URL.Visible = False\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */"
                          },
                          {
                              "blockName":  "Enter",
                              "blockType":  "Event",
                              "rawSource":  "(Extracted from full RTF)",
                              "cleanSource":  "\u0026User = GAMRepository.GetUserToOTPAuthentication(\u0026AuthenticationTypeName, \u0026UseTwoFactorAuthentication, \u0026Errors)\n\tIf \u0026Errors.Count = 0\n\t\t\u0026AdditionalParameter.AuthenticationTypeName \t= \u0026AuthenticationTypeName\n\t\t\u0026AdditionalParameter.UseTwoFactorAuthentication\t= \u0026UseTwoFactorAuthentication\n\t\t\u0026AdditionalParameter.OTPStep\t\t\t\t\t= 2\n\t\t\u0026AdditionalParameter.IDPState\t\t\t\t\t= \u0026IDP_State\n\t\t\u0026LoginOK = GAMRepository.Login(\u0026UserName, \u0026UserPassword, \u0026AdditionalParameter, \u0026Errors )\n\t\tIf \u0026LoginOK\n\t\t\tIf \u0026IDP_State.IsEmpty()\n\t\t\t\t\u0026URL = GAMRepository.GetLastErrorsURL()\n\t\t\t\tIf \u0026URL.IsEmpty()\n\t\t\t\t\thome()\n\t\t\t\tElse\n\t\t\t\t\tLink(\u0026URL)\n\t\t\t\tEndif\n\t\t\tEndif\n\t\tElse\n\t\t\tIf \u0026Errors.Count \u003e 0 \n\t\t\t\tDo Case\n\t\t\t\tCase \u0026Errors.Item(1).Code = GAMErrorMessages.UserMissingRequiredData\n\t\t\t\t\t//Webpanel to Complete User data\n\t\t\t\t\tGAMUpdateRegisterUser(\u0026IDP_State)\n\t\t\t\tOtherwise\n\t\t\t\t\t\u0026UserPassword.SetEmpty()\n\t\t\t\t\tDo \u0027DisplayMessages\u0027\n\t\t\t\tEndCase\n\t\t\tEndif\n\t\tEndif\n\tElse\n\t\tDo \u0027DisplayMessages\u0027\n\tEndif\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */"
                          },
